WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.945 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:43.105 --> 01:44.105
Her Ladyship！

5
01:44.185 --> 01:46.185
You can't take Her Ladyship away!

6
01:46.785 --> 01:47.985
Let Her Ladyship go!

7
01:48.065 --> 01:49.625
Release Her Ladyship!

8
01:50.785 --> 01:51.865
Let her go!

9
01:51.945 --> 01:53.865
Release Her Ladyship!

10
01:53.945 --> 01:55.265
They want to take Her Ladyship away

11
01:55.345 --> 01:57.145
and destroy the home where we've found refuge.

12
01:57.225 --> 01:58.425
Will we stand for that?

13
01:58.505 --> 02:01.665
-No! -No!

14
02:01.745 --> 02:04.345
-Drive them out! Save Her Ladyship! -No!

15
02:05.305 --> 02:08.265
-Fight them! -Fight!

16
02:09.304 --> 02:10.545
Stop them!

17
02:20.905 --> 02:23.145
Protect me! Protect me!

18
02:23.225 --> 02:25.265
Save Her Ladyship!

19
02:26.225 --> 02:27.425
Protect me!

20
02:28.905 --> 02:30.705
Protect me!

21
02:30.785 --> 02:32.305
Fight them!

22
02:34.025 --> 02:34.865
Run!

23
02:34.945 --> 02:36.105
Protect me!

24
02:51.385 --> 02:54.545
Protect me! Protect me!

25
03:00.065 --> 03:01.945
-Aman! -This way!

26
03:02.025 --> 03:02.945
Let's go!

27
03:12.025 --> 03:13.265
Get away!

28
03:13.345 --> 03:14.385
Guards!

29
03:14.465 --> 03:18.025
-Protect Her Majesty! -Protect me! Protect me!

30
03:20.745 --> 03:21.865
Guards!

31
03:28.785 --> 03:29.625
Your Majesty.

32
03:40.465 --> 03:42.065
Here's the old wretch!

33
03:45.505 --> 03:46.425
Your Majesty.

34
03:47.145 --> 03:49.465
How could a mere girl like Wei Rao…?

35
03:53.785 --> 03:54.625
Let's go.

36
04:01.905 --> 04:03.265
Faster!

37
04:11.585 --> 04:12.905
It is you!

38
04:17.504 --> 04:19.825
-What about me? -You faked your illness to trick us.

39
04:20.425 --> 04:21.825
It was all a lie.

40
04:21.905 --> 04:24.585
This was all a trap to lure us out!

41
04:40.385 --> 04:41.945
It's only a minor illness.

42
04:43.505 --> 04:45.145
Even if I went to hell,

43
04:45.985 --> 04:48.385
I'd crawl back out and drag you down with me.

44
04:49.185 --> 04:51.145
I owe you my thanks, my dear cousin.

45
04:51.865 --> 04:54.105
Your greed and cruelty forced my hand

46
04:54.185 --> 04:57.745
and gave me every reason to catch you all in one fell swoop.

47
04:58.425 --> 05:01.145
Just for Hongxian, some lowly maid,

48
05:01.745 --> 05:04.385
and to protect those beggars, you'd go this far?

49
05:05.745 --> 05:09.345
You've betrayed the Wei family and your noble blood.

50
05:09.425 --> 05:11.825
You've brought utter disgrace on our family!

51
05:17.665 --> 05:18.865
How dare you hit me?

52
05:19.465 --> 05:21.785
Noble blood? What a joke.

53
05:21.865 --> 05:23.505
My father died fighting for this country.

54
05:23.585 --> 05:25.265
A hero's blood runs in my veins.

55
05:26.145 --> 05:30.425
And you used the honor he paid for in blood to marry into royalty,

56
05:30.505 --> 05:33.385
then turned around and trampled on his daughter.

57
05:34.065 --> 05:37.425
Your horses trampled the people's fertile fields.

58
05:37.505 --> 05:40.385
You betrayed the people who sustain the nobility

59
05:41.025 --> 05:43.785
and the country made up of those millions of people.

60
05:44.505 --> 05:46.625
You're the real traitors.

61
05:48.025 --> 05:49.065
Wait.

62
05:50.305 --> 05:51.465
Where's the Crown Prince?

63
06:01.705 --> 06:02.825
Go! Move!

64
06:03.465 --> 06:05.345
Your Highness, the road is blocked. What should we do?

65
06:05.945 --> 06:08.585
They're just ahead! Don't let a single one escape!

66
06:21.065 --> 06:22.585
How dare you plot against the Crown Prince!

67
06:23.305 --> 06:24.705
I won't kill him.

68
06:25.305 --> 06:27.905
But he's abused countless girls.

69
06:27.985 --> 06:29.745
He must be punished.

70
06:29.825 --> 06:30.785
I'll make sure he never

71
06:30.865 --> 06:33.105
gets the chance to take the throne in this lifetime.

72
06:33.185 --> 06:34.265
You…

73
06:34.345 --> 06:36.625
And for all your scheming and helping him commit his crimes,

74
06:37.265 --> 06:38.865
you'll never become Empress either.

75
06:39.825 --> 06:40.825
Wei Rao,

76
06:41.945 --> 06:43.385
I'll make you pay!

77
06:53.505 --> 06:55.585
Your Ladyship, this woman has committed every evil.

78
06:55.665 --> 06:57.145
Let her bleed to death.

79
06:57.665 --> 07:00.025
-Carry her back. -Yes.

80
07:18.345 --> 07:21.385
Set traps in the east, south, and west.

81
07:21.465 --> 07:23.305
Leave the north open so the Empress Dowager can escape.

82
07:24.065 --> 07:25.225
What about the Crown Prince?

83
07:28.865 --> 07:30.065
What do you think?

84
07:39.625 --> 07:42.545
Help! I've broken my leg!

85
07:43.505 --> 07:44.905
Help! My leg is broken!

86
07:46.345 --> 07:49.345
Help me. Get me out. My leg is broken!

87
07:49.425 --> 07:50.265
Bring a rope.

88
07:55.745 --> 07:56.945
Hurry.

89
08:04.945 --> 08:05.825
Hurry.

90
08:06.425 --> 08:07.585
Pull me up.

91
08:09.185 --> 08:11.945
Once I'm out, I'll reward you.

92
08:12.025 --> 08:13.465
Pull me up!

93
08:20.145 --> 08:20.985
Hurry!

94
08:29.465 --> 08:31.625
I'll tear you limb from limb!

95
08:32.225 --> 08:36.264
Your Highness, you made women dance barefoot on burning coals

96
08:36.865 --> 08:38.225
and laughed with delight.

97
08:38.865 --> 08:40.144
You never would've imagined

98
08:40.225 --> 08:42.945
that one day, you'd be at someone else's mercy too.

99
08:43.585 --> 08:44.425
Enjoy it.

100
08:46.745 --> 08:48.905
No! Don't leave me here!

101
08:48.985 --> 08:50.265
Help!

102
08:51.265 --> 08:54.585
Don't leave me here! Help me.

103
08:54.665 --> 08:56.145
Help!

104
08:56.225 --> 08:59.425
Get me out! I'll give you gold!

105
08:59.505 --> 09:01.065
Help!

106
09:03.905 --> 09:06.425
Help… Help me.

107
09:08.425 --> 09:10.865
-Let's go. -Help me! I'm begging you!

108
09:10.945 --> 09:12.785
Don't leave me here!

109
09:12.865 --> 09:14.985
I know I was wrong!

110
09:15.585 --> 09:16.505
Your Majesty.

111
09:18.825 --> 09:19.665
Be careful.

112
09:36.025 --> 09:37.265
Lu Zhuo?

113
09:44.425 --> 09:45.905
Greetings, Your Majesty.

114
09:45.985 --> 09:46.945
What happened here?

115
09:47.025 --> 09:49.145
The rabble have rebelled. Hurry.

116
09:49.225 --> 09:50.225
Arrest them at once!

117
09:52.705 --> 09:53.745
My Lord, it's Her Ladyship.

118
10:02.585 --> 10:07.465
My dear, while you were away, they all ganged up on me.

119
10:08.665 --> 10:09.745
Lies!

120
10:09.825 --> 10:11.865
You silver-tongued, venomous snake!

121
10:12.825 --> 10:15.505
Han Liao coerced Madam Liu, duped the Empress Dowager.

122
10:16.345 --> 10:17.905
He accused me of a forged identity

123
10:17.985 --> 10:19.665
and deceiving His Majesty.

124
10:20.185 --> 10:22.065
He even tried to parade me through the streets,

125
10:22.145 --> 10:24.065
which angered the people.

126
10:24.145 --> 10:25.425
In their outrage,

127
10:26.305 --> 10:29.025
they overturned the imperial carriage and frightened Her Majesty.

128
10:29.865 --> 10:30.905
I see.

129
10:31.985 --> 10:35.425
Lu Zhuo, you're an imperial official.

130
10:35.505 --> 10:38.385
You mustn't let personal feelings lead you to cover for this woman.

131
10:38.465 --> 10:41.185
Her Majesty has ordered you to arrest the rebels!

132
10:41.785 --> 10:43.505
The estate has sheltered countless refugees.

133
10:44.305 --> 10:46.065
If Your Majesty wants me to arrest them all,

134
10:46.145 --> 10:50.025
I'm afraid prisoners will fill the streets and pack the prisons.

135
10:50.105 --> 10:52.465
Even ten more imperial prisons won't hold them all.

136
10:52.545 --> 10:54.385
Don't play dumb.

137
10:54.905 --> 10:56.065
Her Majesty wants to arrest

138
10:57.625 --> 10:59.025
Noble Lady Wu'an's accomplices!

139
11:00.385 --> 11:02.785
My wife's growing reputation draws people from far and wide.

140
11:03.465 --> 11:06.545
Even from miles away, people keep coming to seek her protection.

141
11:07.305 --> 11:08.345
Tell me, in all the realm,

142
11:08.985 --> 11:10.225
who with a conscience

143
11:10.305 --> 11:12.505
is her ally?

144
11:12.585 --> 11:14.465
And who isn't?

145
11:15.585 --> 11:19.505
Lord Lu, this woman has blinded you.

146
11:20.105 --> 11:22.425
You even dare defy my decree now.

147
11:23.345 --> 11:26.425
Both she and her mother are seductresses!

148
11:29.585 --> 11:30.465
I feel dizzy.

149
11:31.305 --> 11:32.305
I'll take you back.

150
11:40.745 --> 11:43.545
You…

151
11:44.665 --> 11:46.225
Your Majesty!

152
11:46.305 --> 11:47.985
Back to the palace!

153
11:49.625 --> 11:52.305
-Guards! -Escort me back to the palace!

154
11:53.385 --> 11:55.905
Lu Zhuo, this isn't over.

155
11:56.905 --> 11:59.985
When His Majesty returns, you'll answer for this.

156
12:10.785 --> 12:12.665
He's taking my horse!

157
12:15.345 --> 12:16.185
Satisfied?

158
12:17.945 --> 12:19.665
I just want to piss off that old witch.

159
12:28.105 --> 12:30.145
You're burning up, yet you're still running around?

160
12:30.785 --> 12:32.945
-I still have business to take care of. -We're going back.

161
12:39.625 --> 12:41.745
CAISHU HALL

162
12:41.825 --> 12:46.825
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

163
13:04.945 --> 13:08.065
First, tell me where you're holding the Crown Prince.

164
13:08.905 --> 13:11.465
That Crown Prince is such a coward.

165
13:11.545 --> 13:14.105
The people gave him a fright, and he vanished without a trace.

166
13:14.185 --> 13:16.745
I don't know where he is now.

167
13:27.865 --> 13:30.465
I'll find him even if you won't tell me.

168
13:32.505 --> 13:33.585
Where's my grandmother?

169
13:35.585 --> 13:36.465
She's in a guest room.

170
13:37.065 --> 13:39.705
I should go and see her so she won't worry.

171
13:48.345 --> 13:51.305
Aman, go and tell Grandmother I'm all right.

172
13:51.985 --> 13:53.545
I must rest and recover,

173
13:55.665 --> 13:58.145
-as my husband says. -Yes.

174
14:32.665 --> 14:36.945
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

175
14:37.785 --> 14:39.105
Where is the Crown Prince?

176
14:39.625 --> 14:42.425
-Lord Lu, we haven't… -Think twice before you answer.

177
14:43.505 --> 14:45.545
Lady Rao has caused a major crisis.

178
14:46.145 --> 14:48.025
If you won't tell me the truth now,

179
14:48.105 --> 14:50.425
she'll have to defend herself before His Majesty while ill.

180
14:50.945 --> 14:51.865
She's seriously ill.

181
14:53.945 --> 14:55.025
Do you want to kill her?

182
14:56.025 --> 14:58.465
Lord Lu, I'll tell you the truth.

183
14:58.985 --> 15:02.065
The Crown Prince ran off blindly and accidentally fell into a hunting pit.

184
15:03.625 --> 15:04.985
I rushed back to tell Her Ladyship.

185
15:05.065 --> 15:08.345
I was just about to fetch ropes and a sedan chair to bring him back.

186
15:10.225 --> 15:12.025
Of all the things you could learn from her,

187
15:12.105 --> 15:14.585
you've learned only how to evade questions and deceive people.

188
15:16.065 --> 15:17.065
You speak truly, my Lord.

189
15:19.025 --> 15:20.305
Come along!

190
15:24.185 --> 15:25.985
CHANGLE PALACE

191
15:26.065 --> 15:30.265
Why haven't you sent troops to rescue the Crown Prince and arrest Wu'an?

192
15:30.345 --> 15:34.745
Han Liao, do you mean to defy my decree too?

193
15:35.985 --> 15:36.825
Please, Your Majesty.

194
15:36.905 --> 15:39.585
My life and fortunes depend entirely on you.

195
15:40.225 --> 15:41.865
How could I dare disobey?

196
15:42.665 --> 15:45.265
We can't hide this uprising from His Majesty.

197
15:45.345 --> 15:46.985
He has surely been informed by now.

198
15:47.065 --> 15:49.625
Wei Rao incited the people to rebel.

199
15:49.705 --> 15:50.865
That crime warrants the extermination of her entire clan.

200
15:52.145 --> 15:54.265
His Majesty won't spare her.

201
15:54.865 --> 15:56.225
What about the Crown Prince?

202
15:56.825 --> 15:59.905
He's His Majesty's own son.

203
16:00.425 --> 16:01.625
However grave his crimes,

204
16:01.705 --> 16:03.465
only His Majesty can judge his case.

205
16:04.065 --> 16:05.745
Others have no right to interfere.

206
16:05.825 --> 16:09.385
Wei Rao would never dare kill His Highness.

207
16:09.465 --> 16:12.185
At most, she'll make him suffer a little longer.

208
16:12.785 --> 16:16.665
You said we could charge her with treason?

209
16:16.745 --> 16:17.745
ETERNAL SPLENDOR

210
16:17.825 --> 16:19.745
As the ringleader of this treason,

211
16:20.825 --> 16:22.825
she should die by slow slicing.

212
16:24.745 --> 16:28.305
She's brought this on herself.

213
16:43.145 --> 16:46.305
Traitor! You traitor!

214
17:03.505 --> 17:07.345
Lord Lu, please have me taken home to recover.

215
17:08.224 --> 17:10.745
Zhao Song, escort His Highness home.

216
17:11.745 --> 17:12.704
Yes.

217
17:25.224 --> 17:27.464
Lu Zhuo, Wu'an,

218
17:28.145 --> 17:32.225
one day I'll tear you both limb from limb and grind your bones to dust!

219
17:40.425 --> 17:43.665
Lord Lu, the Crown Prince fell by accident.

220
17:45.945 --> 17:46.905
You think I'm buying that?

221
17:47.505 --> 17:49.625
Her Ladyship said, "If we're going to do this,

222
17:49.705 --> 17:51.145
we must finish it for good.

223
17:51.825 --> 17:52.985
Leave him to rot in that pit

224
17:53.065 --> 17:54.745
until nothing remains but bones in a decade.

225
17:54.825 --> 17:56.025
Even if the truth comes out,

226
17:56.105 --> 17:59.625
taking the Crown Prince down with us would make dying worthwhile."

227
17:59.705 --> 18:00.785
Just shut it, okay?

228
18:01.385 --> 18:03.105
She'd never settle for mutual destruction.

229
18:03.825 --> 18:05.225
Surely plotting something else.

230
18:06.465 --> 18:09.625
Lord Lu, they say birds of a feather flock together.

231
18:09.705 --> 18:12.625
You really do know Her Ladyship inside out.

232
18:20.865 --> 18:24.505
Well, well, of course this is your idea, Wei Rao.

233
18:25.745 --> 18:26.865
You naughty girl!

234
18:26.945 --> 18:28.785
You nearly scared me to death!

235
18:28.865 --> 18:30.425
Grandmother, keep your voice down.

236
18:30.505 --> 18:31.625
Don't let him hear you.

237
18:31.705 --> 18:35.185
You've taken on the Crown Prince and the Empress Dowager.

238
18:35.265 --> 18:38.025
You're fearless! Who are you afraid to be heard?

239
18:38.105 --> 18:41.425
Lu Zhuo. He's terrifying when he scolds me.

240
18:45.305 --> 18:47.505
So a man can keep you in line after all?

241
18:47.585 --> 18:48.985
Is that all you've got?

242
18:53.025 --> 18:55.185
You're always the kindest to me, Grandmother.

243
18:55.785 --> 18:57.505
I shouldn't have kept things from you.

244
18:57.585 --> 19:00.065
If you want to hit me, go ahead.

245
19:00.145 --> 19:01.305
I…

246
19:04.625 --> 19:06.225
Oh, you!

247
19:06.305 --> 19:08.785
You've got such a wicked mind!

248
19:08.865 --> 19:12.705
Even good old wood ash couldn't scrub it clean.

249
19:13.505 --> 19:15.785
He's the Crown Prince, you know.

250
19:15.865 --> 19:18.145
Are you really not afraid?

251
19:18.225 --> 19:20.025
I hear the Crown Prince has broken his leg.

252
19:20.705 --> 19:22.665
In the 150 years since our dynasty was founded,

253
19:22.745 --> 19:24.185
never seen a crown prince so low

254
19:24.265 --> 19:25.785
and so morally crippled.

255
19:27.665 --> 19:30.025
No reckless talk of the Crown Prince's rise or fall.

256
19:30.105 --> 19:31.665
You're the one who said it.

257
19:38.985 --> 19:41.745
The Empress Dowager has long resented me.

258
19:41.825 --> 19:44.105
She'll stop at nothing to have you killed.

259
19:44.905 --> 19:47.505
What do you plan to do next?

260
19:50.825 --> 19:52.785
Here's what we'll do.

261
19:52.865 --> 19:56.945
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

262
19:57.985 --> 20:00.385
XUANSHI PALACE

263
20:03.745 --> 20:04.785
Your Majesty.

264
20:10.265 --> 20:12.305
I know the whole story now.

265
20:12.985 --> 20:15.545
How badly is your leg injured?

266
20:15.625 --> 20:17.945
Father, please give me justice.

267
20:18.025 --> 20:19.265
ZHENG TAN, GRAND COMMANDANT, LADY ZHENG'S ELDEST BROTHER

268
20:19.345 --> 20:24.345
Your Majesty, Wu'an incited the mob to beat the Crown Prince so severely.

269
20:24.425 --> 20:26.905
The imperial physicians say his leg is beyond repair.

270
20:26.985 --> 20:28.705
He may never walk normally again.

271
20:29.665 --> 20:32.305
General Han and the Imperial Guards can testify to this.

272
20:32.385 --> 20:36.025
I beg Your Majesty to punish the ringleader, Noble Lady Wu'an.

273
20:36.905 --> 20:39.945
Then what punishment do you propose?

274
20:41.465 --> 20:45.225
Your Majesty, first, Wu'an led a mob against Her Majesty's procession,

275
20:45.305 --> 20:46.265
showing disrespect.

276
20:46.865 --> 20:50.745
Second, she incited the refugees to riot, which amounts to treason.

277
20:51.785 --> 20:54.065
Wu'an, as the ringleader, should die by slow slicing.

278
20:54.705 --> 20:56.185
All her followers should be hanged.

279
20:56.265 --> 20:58.785
Make an example of them to deter others.

280
20:59.705 --> 21:04.505
So, the Crown Prince, the Grand Commandant, and Han Liao

281
21:04.585 --> 21:06.425
all call for the death penalty?

282
21:10.145 --> 21:12.385
We humbly await Your Majesty's judgment!

283
21:16.545 --> 21:17.385
XUANSHI PALACE

284
21:17.465 --> 21:20.345
How can I persuade Father to show my sister mercy?

285
21:20.425 --> 21:21.785
Zhuo.

286
21:23.305 --> 21:24.345
My brother-in-law?

287
21:24.865 --> 21:28.665
You needn't say anything, Your Highness. You don't need to plead for Wei Rao.

288
21:29.585 --> 21:31.225
Everyone wants Rao dead.

289
21:31.305 --> 21:33.225
Her life is at stake. How can I stay silent?

290
21:35.825 --> 21:39.105
Love for your siblings is only natural,

291
21:39.185 --> 21:41.425
but you must also consider your bond with your father.

292
21:42.585 --> 21:45.825
Sometimes, silence speaks louder than any argument.

293
21:47.105 --> 21:50.865
Think carefully about what I've said, and you'll know what to do.

294
22:03.865 --> 22:04.745
How is Rao?

295
22:05.345 --> 22:07.345
Have the two imperial physicians I sent examined her?

296
22:07.945 --> 22:09.865
Summon them. I'll talk to them myself.

297
22:09.945 --> 22:11.225
I took the physicians there,

298
22:11.305 --> 22:16.105
but Her Ladyship was gravely ill and too distressed to see anyone.

299
22:20.425 --> 22:21.705
Everyone, leave us.

300
22:26.385 --> 22:30.065
Your Ladyship, Noble Lady Wu'an had a maid lie in bed in her place.

301
22:30.145 --> 22:31.585
She wasn't at the estate at all.

302
22:37.425 --> 22:39.025
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

303
22:41.985 --> 22:43.425
Water.

304
22:45.985 --> 22:47.065
Anyone?

305
23:11.425 --> 23:13.985
Shu, I've come to visit you.

306
23:15.345 --> 23:18.265
You kindly helped the Crown Prince devise his plans,

307
23:18.345 --> 23:19.865
yet he took his anger out on you,

308
23:19.945 --> 23:22.145
refused to let you recover in his residence.

309
23:22.225 --> 23:23.905
Here you are, unwillingly on Wei's property.

310
23:28.185 --> 23:29.945
How heartless of him.

311
23:32.985 --> 23:34.105
What?

312
23:35.225 --> 23:38.665
Now everyone at Xuanshi Palace wants you dead.

313
23:38.745 --> 23:42.025
Instead of clinging to Lady Li and begging for mercy,

314
23:42.105 --> 23:45.145
you are here to enjoy the show at my expense?

315
23:52.625 --> 23:55.705
GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

316
23:59.465 --> 24:00.985
Trying to beg my forgiveness?

317
24:02.545 --> 24:04.025
Too late.

318
24:04.105 --> 24:08.545
I'll watch the executioner slice the flesh from your bones!

319
24:08.625 --> 24:09.465
Shu,

320
24:10.625 --> 24:12.185
we're both recovering from illness.

321
24:12.265 --> 24:13.985
We both have time on our hands.

322
24:14.865 --> 24:15.945
Why don't we play a game?

323
24:16.545 --> 24:18.025
What game?

324
24:18.825 --> 24:20.545
How about we make a bet?

325
24:22.105 --> 24:23.905
Will His Majesty have me killed or not?

326
24:24.785 --> 24:28.265
And the stakes? Your life.

327
24:28.865 --> 24:32.305
You injured the Crown Prince, attacked Her Majesty's procession,

328
24:32.385 --> 24:34.385
and led a rebellion. Your crimes are unforgivable.

329
24:35.185 --> 24:36.785
You still think you can escape death?

330
24:38.225 --> 24:40.345
You're deluding yourself!

331
24:47.465 --> 24:48.625
This is the Crown Prince.

332
24:54.945 --> 24:56.585
This is the Fourth Prince, Liu Shuo.

333
25:01.625 --> 25:04.625
Liu Shuo, have you come to plead for your sister?

334
25:07.505 --> 25:12.305
Father, before I entered, I had so much to say in her defense.

335
25:13.025 --> 25:14.465
But now that I'm here,

336
25:14.985 --> 25:17.425
I see how weary you look and how much weight you've lost.

337
25:18.145 --> 25:19.865
You haven't fully recovered,

338
25:19.945 --> 25:21.705
yet you rushed back to the palace overnight.

339
25:21.785 --> 25:24.865
My heart aches to see you ill, Father.

340
25:24.945 --> 25:26.465
I can't take your place in suffering

341
25:26.545 --> 25:27.385
that alone is the deepest unfiliality.

342
25:27.985 --> 25:31.065
I dare not plead for my sister and add to your worries.

343
25:34.865 --> 25:35.705
Rise.

344
25:36.545 --> 25:39.545
You're still young. Stand aside and listen.

345
25:40.905 --> 25:42.945
People always favor their youngest sons.

346
25:43.745 --> 25:46.385
But the Crown Prince is the heir to the throne.

347
25:47.065 --> 25:49.305
He commands great respect and has saved His Majesty's life.

348
25:49.905 --> 25:52.505
Liu Shuo? He's not even worthy to be compared.

349
25:53.105 --> 25:59.145
Besides, the Crown Prince has the Zheng family behind him.

350
26:02.385 --> 26:06.065
Lu Zhuo, the Lu family has always been loyal, brave,

351
26:06.145 --> 26:07.425
and a pillar of the realm.

352
26:07.505 --> 26:09.505
Would you really betray His Majesty's favor

353
26:10.185 --> 26:13.505
and disregard the law because of one woman?

354
26:14.185 --> 26:16.345
When the people of Liangzhou and Bingzhou rose up,

355
26:17.265 --> 26:19.225
His Majesty was furious and had those land-grabbing clans executed

356
26:19.825 --> 26:21.905
and pardoned the people who rebelled.

357
26:21.985 --> 26:24.985
What an emperor fears isn't peasants armed with farm tools

358
26:26.705 --> 26:28.185
but the loss of their support.

359
26:29.345 --> 26:30.505
As heir to the throne,

360
26:30.585 --> 26:32.585
the Crown Prince stormed the estate to settle a private grudge.

361
26:33.945 --> 26:36.025
He provoked the people's outrage.

362
26:36.105 --> 26:37.785
Lu Zhuo, how dare you!

363
26:37.865 --> 26:39.665
Lord Lu wants to argue that the law can't punish the many,

364
26:39.745 --> 26:41.145
to get Her Ladyship off the hook.

365
26:41.225 --> 26:43.865
But in that case, powerful men drove the people to revolt.

366
26:43.945 --> 26:46.585
Wu'an, however, deliberately incited the ignorant masses.

367
26:46.665 --> 26:49.305
That is treason! Rebellion!

368
26:49.865 --> 26:51.465
The two cases are entirely different!

369
26:51.545 --> 26:53.745
Wu'an endangered the realm and incited a revolt.

370
26:53.825 --> 26:55.705
She must die, Your Majesty!

371
26:59.025 --> 27:00.265
Take a look, Your Majesty.

372
27:03.665 --> 27:06.145
The Imperial Guards took a shortcut through the fields

373
27:06.865 --> 27:09.065
and trampled vast stretches of wheat seedlings.

374
27:09.145 --> 27:11.425
But these are more than seedlings.

375
27:11.505 --> 27:13.985
They embody the people's trust

376
27:14.945 --> 27:17.025
that Your Majesty works day and night to restore.

377
27:17.105 --> 27:18.665
Lu Zhuo!

378
27:18.745 --> 27:20.905
From ancient times, those with farm tools are honest folk

379
27:20.985 --> 27:23.105
and those bearing weapons have been outlaws.

380
27:23.785 --> 27:27.385
Who overturned her carriage? Was it angry folks

381
27:27.905 --> 27:29.225
or rebellious outlaws?

382
27:29.905 --> 27:30.825
Lu Zhuo…

383
27:30.905 --> 27:34.145
Your Majesty rules with mercy, cautious in punishment and execution.

384
27:34.225 --> 27:36.545
Wu'an sheltered refugees and reclaimed farmlands.

385
27:37.305 --> 27:40.225
You drove those farmers to take up their tools as weapons.

386
27:42.065 --> 27:45.065
You. You are the ones to blame.

387
27:45.705 --> 27:47.065
You're the real traitors here.

388
27:47.865 --> 27:50.625
Father, I…

389
27:52.505 --> 27:54.785
I only went because I heard Wu'an had a fake identity.

390
27:55.305 --> 27:57.385
I didn't know, Father!

391
27:58.705 --> 28:02.985
An heir so foolish and incompetent, who has lost the people's support.

392
28:03.065 --> 28:06.265
How can I entrust him with the realm and the people's welfare?

393
28:07.905 --> 28:09.505
Father, please show mercy.

394
28:09.585 --> 28:12.265
Spare my sister and those desperate folk.

395
28:20.665 --> 28:21.705
The Lu family?

396
28:22.505 --> 28:23.985
Oh, Wei Rao,

397
28:24.585 --> 28:26.665
Lady Li has schemed for years,

398
28:26.745 --> 28:28.585
yet the title of Empress is beyond her reach.

399
28:28.665 --> 28:30.705
All because the Zhou family has no powerful backer

400
28:31.465 --> 28:33.185
to speak for her at court.

401
28:34.465 --> 28:37.585
I have to admire the wonderful marriage alliance

402
28:37.665 --> 28:39.865
you've secured for yourself.

403
28:43.585 --> 28:46.025
No? What have I got wrong?

404
28:46.905 --> 28:50.545
Lu Zhuo wouldn't let his feelings for me override the law

405
28:51.065 --> 28:52.225
for any personal gain.

406
28:52.825 --> 28:55.585
If not the Lu family, then what?

407
28:58.385 --> 28:59.345
Lord Lu.

408
29:00.065 --> 29:01.385
The Heir of Duke of Ying.

409
29:01.465 --> 29:03.745
So just and impartial, free of personal bias,

410
29:03.825 --> 29:04.945
XUANSHI PALACE

411
29:05.025 --> 29:08.625
has now let a woman make him disregard the law.

412
29:10.625 --> 29:13.305
I never thought I'd see the day.

413
29:14.505 --> 29:18.665
Lu Zhuo, you once condemned me for being corrupt,

414
29:18.745 --> 29:20.145
for lining my own pockets.

415
29:20.225 --> 29:22.945
Doesn't what you've done today make you a hypocrite?

416
29:25.105 --> 29:28.065
You think His Majesty is hesitating because of the Lu family?

417
29:29.025 --> 29:30.065
Isn't he?

418
29:35.585 --> 29:36.865
What's the most disappointed

419
29:37.465 --> 29:39.785
was that, to settle a private grudge,

420
29:39.865 --> 29:42.825
the Crown Prince openly displayed his brutality, petty-mindedness,

421
29:42.905 --> 29:44.865
and lawlessness before all the people.

422
29:45.865 --> 29:48.225
The moment the Crown Prince's cavalry set foot in Zhuyu Estate,

423
29:48.985 --> 29:50.825
he'd already fallen into Wei Rao's trap.

424
29:52.225 --> 29:58.665
His Majesty could never allow a foolish incompetent to be his heir.

425
30:03.865 --> 30:09.105
So he lost to me in goodwill, in justice,

426
30:09.705 --> 30:11.545
and in people's support.

427
30:16.985 --> 30:18.545
There's still someone

428
30:19.265 --> 30:21.705
who can sway His Majesty and decide the outcome.

429
30:23.705 --> 30:27.665
Wei Rao, you can't win.

430
30:30.345 --> 30:32.625
The Empress Dowager wants you dead.

431
30:33.945 --> 30:37.425
Mother, I've been here for you so long.

432
30:37.505 --> 30:39.425
Please eat at least a little.

433
30:40.105 --> 30:42.065
Yes, my brother is wrong.

434
30:42.145 --> 30:43.585
I'll have him come here,

435
30:43.665 --> 30:45.465
and you can scold him all you like. All right?

436
30:46.265 --> 30:49.145
He's rebellious to the bone.

437
30:49.225 --> 30:52.225
Whatever I tell him, he does the opposite.

438
30:52.305 --> 30:54.945
How is he my son?

439
30:55.025 --> 30:58.305
He's more like that wretched Lady Zhou's child.

440
31:02.345 --> 31:03.185
Leave us.

441
31:03.265 --> 31:05.505
CELESTIAL SPLENDOR

442
31:06.625 --> 31:10.065
Mother, you mustn't say such things.

443
31:10.145 --> 31:11.945
You'll break His Majesty's heart.

444
31:12.025 --> 31:14.105
Greetings, Your Majesty.

445
31:14.705 --> 31:18.585
Now that he's Emperor, he's forgotten

446
31:18.665 --> 31:21.665
the mother who bore and raised him, his own flesh and blood.

447
31:22.385 --> 31:24.905
It's as if he's bewitched.

448
31:24.985 --> 31:26.945
He favors an official's wife,

449
31:27.025 --> 31:29.545
dotes on another man's daughter,

450
31:29.625 --> 31:31.945
and cares nothing for his own son.

451
31:32.705 --> 31:37.745
At heart, he resents me, his mother,

452
31:37.825 --> 31:42.585
and treats that lowly wet nurse as his own mother instead.

453
31:43.425 --> 31:44.465
Have you forgotten?

454
31:48.545 --> 31:49.545
We've got Lady Shou'an.

455
31:56.905 --> 32:00.105
Mother, are you truly my mother?

456
32:02.145 --> 32:05.185
How dare you say such a thing?

457
32:06.505 --> 32:09.585
Ever since I can remember, only my wet nurse was there for me.

458
32:10.185 --> 32:14.105
Where was my own mother when I needed her?

459
32:15.545 --> 32:20.065
Back then, life in the palace was a constant struggle.

460
32:20.705 --> 32:25.505
Keeping you and your brother safe was no easy task.

461
32:25.585 --> 32:27.665
How could I attend to everything?

462
32:27.745 --> 32:30.465
Do you still resent me over such trifles?

463
32:30.545 --> 32:32.025
Is that really how it was?

464
32:33.065 --> 32:37.625
I remember how my brother and I went to the lake without our wet nurse knowing

465
32:37.705 --> 32:39.105
and fell into the water.

466
32:40.105 --> 32:42.705
We were rescued, but both became seriously ill.

467
32:42.785 --> 32:48.345
During the half month I lay ill, you stayed by my brother's side.

468
32:48.425 --> 32:49.145
‎YUNIANG, YOUNG LADY SHOU'AN

469
32:49.225 --> 32:51.145
Did you ever think of me?

470
32:51.225 --> 32:53.705
As the six-year-old Seventh Prince, I couldn't understand.

471
32:54.905 --> 32:57.585
We were brothers born of the same mother.

472
32:58.905 --> 33:04.545
Why did you favor one so much and neglect the other?

473
33:06.625 --> 33:08.145
Later, I understood.

474
33:09.705 --> 33:14.145
My brother was talented and adored by Father.

475
33:15.065 --> 33:17.705
He was your greatest asset in the struggle for power.

476
33:18.385 --> 33:22.545
And I was nothing more than a foolish child.

477
33:23.145 --> 33:27.105
How could I compare with the brother who could bring you glory and power?

478
33:29.105 --> 33:31.505
Only when he died young of illness

479
33:32.105 --> 33:37.985
and all your hopes were dashed did you finally think of me.

480
33:39.825 --> 33:44.065
Even if I neglected you and treated you coldly,

481
33:45.265 --> 33:47.545
you're still my own flesh and blood.

482
33:48.825 --> 33:50.705
Mine!

483
33:50.785 --> 33:53.505
You shouldn't have grown close to a wet nurse

484
33:54.665 --> 33:56.425
or granted that wretch a title.

485
33:57.185 --> 34:00.745
You've let the whole world know that the Emperor

486
34:01.345 --> 34:03.905
treats his wet nurse as his own mother.

487
34:03.985 --> 34:06.985
You even brought her widowed daughter into the palace.

488
34:07.505 --> 34:09.865
How you've humiliated me!

489
34:10.705 --> 34:14.304
So, you want to kill her,

490
34:15.105 --> 34:18.344
the woman who fed your son with her own milk and raised him.

491
34:19.344 --> 34:23.545
who risked her life again and again to protect me?

492
34:27.505 --> 34:29.705
She never tried to take your place.

493
34:31.185 --> 34:33.344
She kept telling me the same lie.

494
34:34.385 --> 34:37.385
She said, "Your mother is very busy.

495
34:37.985 --> 34:39.545
She'll come soon."

496
34:40.545 --> 34:41.985
But you never did.

497
34:42.065 --> 34:43.824
Not once.

498
34:45.304 --> 34:49.105
Yes, she fulfilled your duties as a mother.

499
34:50.105 --> 34:52.545
But her place in my heart

500
34:53.585 --> 34:55.784
was one you willingly gave up.

501
34:56.705 --> 34:58.385
That's ancient history.

502
34:59.185 --> 35:00.745
There's no point dwelling on it.

503
35:07.385 --> 35:13.425
Your Majesty, the whole world saw that mob overturn my imperial carriage.

504
35:13.505 --> 35:17.865
If you regard me as your mother and this country's Empress Dowager,

505
35:18.545 --> 35:23.865
you must uphold my dignity and execute Wu'an, the ringleader.

506
35:25.545 --> 35:28.985
Kill her! I order you to kill her!

507
35:29.505 --> 35:30.865
Your Majesty!

508
35:32.105 --> 35:33.225
Your Majesty!

509
35:36.505 --> 35:39.505
Your Majesty, Lady Shou'an has entered the palace.

510
35:48.465 --> 35:49.745
Your Majesty…

511
35:53.145 --> 35:54.945
An emperor has only one mother.

512
35:56.145 --> 35:58.945
I am the one who gave birth to you!

513
36:02.425 --> 36:05.865
Wei Rao must die.

514
36:07.305 --> 36:08.905
She must die!

515
36:14.905 --> 36:15.905
Your Majesty.

516
36:18.145 --> 36:20.105
Hasn't Lady Shou'an arrived?

517
36:24.905 --> 36:26.265
Mother was here.

518
36:26.985 --> 36:29.865
She brought a basket of spring delicacies she'd prepared herself.

519
36:29.945 --> 36:35.105
She hoped to cheer you up and persuade you to pardon Rao.

520
36:45.065 --> 36:48.585
If she came to plead, why did she leave?

521
36:49.545 --> 36:52.625
I told Mother you were unwell.

522
36:53.465 --> 36:57.705
I've told you to stop taking elixirs, but you won't listen.

523
36:57.785 --> 37:00.185
Mother grew anxious when she heard.

524
37:00.785 --> 37:01.985
She hurried home,

525
37:02.065 --> 37:04.025
saying she had to find something called Baoyuan Pills,

526
37:04.825 --> 37:08.505
that they were made using a renowned Jiangnan physician's secret recipe,

527
37:08.585 --> 37:11.345
and that they could restore vitality and cure all ailments.

528
37:11.425 --> 37:14.425
She'd originally been saving them for Rao.

529
37:14.505 --> 37:17.305
Afraid the maids wouldn't find them, she went to fetch them herself.

530
37:23.705 --> 37:27.345
She still remembers how much I like these wild scallions.

531
37:33.345 --> 37:34.905
They taste just as I remember.

532
37:43.025 --> 37:45.265
Aren't you going to plead for your daughter?

533
37:46.385 --> 37:48.585
Many at court now see her as a threat.

534
37:49.185 --> 37:52.705
They say she incited a revolt and has great ambitions.

535
37:54.345 --> 37:55.705
That's easily solved.

536
37:55.785 --> 37:57.985
Depose the Crown Prince and let Shuo take his place.

537
37:58.585 --> 37:59.905
She's Shuo's own sister.

538
37:59.985 --> 38:02.625
-Would she rebel against her own brother? -How dare you!

539
38:03.625 --> 38:08.065
Yes, I've overstepped and meddled in state affairs.

540
38:08.145 --> 38:10.185
Have my head, Your Majesty.

541
38:11.945 --> 38:13.905
All right. That's enough.

542
38:13.985 --> 38:15.745
How many times have I told you?

543
38:16.785 --> 38:18.145
Don't let your feelings show.

544
38:18.865 --> 38:21.905
However turbulent they are, keep your composure.

545
38:21.985 --> 38:23.305
But you?

546
38:23.385 --> 38:25.705
You just can't keep your thoughts to yourself.

547
38:25.785 --> 38:27.305
If I weren't protecting you,

548
38:27.385 --> 38:29.825
they'd have devoured you, bones and all!

549
38:30.865 --> 38:32.385
Listen. From now on,

550
38:32.465 --> 38:35.665
those private thoughts must never be shared with outsiders.

551
38:44.505 --> 38:45.985
Actually, Your Majesty,

552
38:46.505 --> 38:49.265
it doesn't matter whom you name Crown Prince.

553
38:49.945 --> 38:51.745
May Your Majesty live a long life,

554
38:51.825 --> 38:54.505
so my children and I can enjoy lasting peace.

555
38:58.105 --> 39:00.345
Elixirs may preserve youth and prolong life,

556
39:00.425 --> 39:04.185
but they're potent and weaken the body with prolonged use.

557
39:04.265 --> 39:06.385
You should take less of them.

558
39:09.305 --> 39:10.345
I know.

559
39:16.545 --> 39:17.625
Your Majesty,

560
39:19.385 --> 39:20.985
are you really going to kill my daughter?

561
39:34.025 --> 39:37.705
Ask no further. I'll make my own decision.

562
39:38.345 --> 39:39.185
XUANSHI PALACE

563
39:39.265 --> 39:41.585
Wei Rao has committed a monstrous crime.

564
39:42.105 --> 39:46.425
I don't believe you can save her this time.

565
39:48.745 --> 39:51.625
Whether she lives or dies, is executed or spared,

566
39:52.225 --> 39:53.505
we'll know soon enough.

567
39:55.465 --> 39:56.905
Why the rush, Lord Han?

568
40:06.385 --> 40:07.385
Here it comes.

569
40:12.105 --> 40:13.825
Emperors are human too.

570
40:14.345 --> 40:16.825
Humans weigh the costs and benefits.

571
40:18.425 --> 40:20.465
On one side, the Crown Prince, the Zheng family, and the Empress Dowager.

572
40:21.065 --> 40:24.545
On the other, Liu Shuo, the people's support, and Lady Shou'an.

573
40:25.745 --> 40:29.705
Once he's weighed them, which side will he choose?

574
40:33.705 --> 40:36.105
Perhaps I was born a gambler.

575
40:37.505 --> 40:39.025
I'm betting His Majesty will…

576
40:44.705 --> 40:46.945
Your Ladyship, a decree has arrived from the palace.

577
40:47.025 --> 40:48.185
"The Crown Prince let his troops destroy crops and harm the people.

578
40:48.785 --> 40:50.985
He is ordered to compensate the people in full for their lost grain.

579
40:51.585 --> 40:53.065
Noble Lady Wu'an failed to maintain discipline

580
40:53.145 --> 40:54.545
and allowed her people to frighten the Empress Dowager.

581
40:54.625 --> 40:56.305
In view of her illness,

582
40:56.385 --> 40:59.105
her punishment is limited to forfeiture of three years' stipend

583
40:59.185 --> 41:01.585
and house confinement to reflect on her conduct."

584
41:11.465 --> 41:12.985
I won.

585
41:13.065 --> 41:17.305
Why? Why won't he kill you even after all this?

586
41:18.585 --> 41:21.265
The heaviest weight on your side is the Empress Dowager.

587
41:21.345 --> 41:23.145
She may be His Majesty's birth mother,

588
41:23.665 --> 41:26.145
but years of coldness and distance have weakened that bond.

589
41:26.225 --> 41:28.425
It cannot outweigh the stability of his realm.

590
41:29.745 --> 41:31.105
His beloved consort, youngest son,

591
41:31.185 --> 41:33.265
wet nurse's care, and the people's support.

592
41:33.345 --> 41:34.985
He wants them all.

593
41:36.625 --> 41:38.225
That's the Emperor.

594
41:39.545 --> 41:40.745
That's human nature.

595
41:40.825 --> 41:43.025
Shut up!

596
41:45.345 --> 41:46.505
Shu,

597
41:48.665 --> 41:49.905
the game's over.

598
41:49.985 --> 41:51.585
No!

599
41:52.105 --> 41:54.785
You haven't won! You haven't!

600
42:01.385 --> 42:02.625
There's still a chance.

601
42:03.665 --> 42:05.265
There must be.

602
42:07.385 --> 42:11.385
Wei Shu, you can't concede.

603
42:13.665 --> 42:16.225
You mustn't let this break you.

604
42:29.265 --> 42:31.425
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

605
42:31.505 --> 42:32.345
Where have you been?

606
42:38.505 --> 42:39.985
You're back, my dear.

607
42:40.825 --> 42:43.105
-I went to visit Grandmother. -Liar.

608
42:43.705 --> 42:45.465
You're still ill, yet you keep running around.

609
42:46.185 --> 42:47.825
You clearly never took what I said seriously.

610
42:49.545 --> 42:51.225
I shouldn't have bothered worrying.

611
42:53.025 --> 42:54.185
Do as you please.

612
42:58.265 --> 43:00.825
Don't be angry. I know I was wrong.

613
43:02.665 --> 43:03.985
Where did you really go?

614
43:06.825 --> 43:09.865
All right. I'll tell you.

615
43:12.065 --> 43:15.545
Even though you've seen all my faults for yourself,

616
43:16.225 --> 43:17.625
for some reason,

617
43:18.465 --> 43:24.785
I still want you to think of me as someone kinder and better.

618
43:43.105 --> 43:44.465
I went to see Wei Shu

619
43:45.865 --> 43:47.665
and kick her while she was down.

620
43:48.465 --> 43:52.105
I enjoyed it so much that I feel half recovered already.

621
43:54.905 --> 43:57.305
Come on, don't be angry.

622
43:57.825 --> 44:00.065
I promise I'll stay in bed and rest.

623
44:00.145 --> 44:01.465
No more running around.

624
44:10.145 --> 44:14.745
Do you realize what you just said?

625
44:16.185 --> 44:18.905
I promised to rest and focus on getting well.

626
44:29.025 --> 44:29.905
As long as you remember.

627
44:32.665 --> 44:33.905
You go ahead and sleep tonight.

628
44:34.785 --> 44:35.905
I have something to attend to.

629
44:41.305 --> 44:45.825
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

630
45:03.465 --> 45:04.585
Come out.

631
45:12.505 --> 45:15.465
Don't get me wrong. I only came to see how she's doing.

632
45:20.825 --> 45:22.025
I have something to ask you.

633
45:24.745 --> 45:27.465
BLOSSOMS OF GRACE

634
45:27.545 --> 45:29.985
-Lu Zhuo, actually, I came tonight… -When a woman starts worrying

635
45:30.065 --> 45:32.825
about what kind of person you think she is,

636
45:32.905 --> 45:33.945
what do you think it means?

637
45:34.625 --> 45:35.785
What?

638
45:35.865 --> 45:38.505
It must mean she's fallen in love.

639
45:40.105 --> 45:40.945
Yes.

640
45:41.025 --> 45:43.025
She's always been decisive.

641
45:43.105 --> 45:44.705
She doesn't care what others think.

642
45:44.785 --> 45:47.585
Why else would she start caring unless she'd fallen in love?

643
45:49.105 --> 45:51.265
Yes, that must be it.

644
45:52.625 --> 45:55.425
If you're not sure, why not ask her?

645
45:56.305 --> 45:58.065
Why ask an outsider like me?

646
45:58.665 --> 46:00.425
No one ever loved her properly as a child.

647
46:00.505 --> 46:01.905
She doesn't know her own feelings.

648
46:01.985 --> 46:02.825
Why ask?

649
46:02.905 --> 46:06.145
Perhaps you're just so lovesick you're imagining things.

650
46:17.065 --> 46:18.065
Who's imagining things now?

651
46:19.065 --> 46:21.705
This jade is naturally warm to the touch.

652
46:21.785 --> 46:23.705
Wearing it will keep the cold at bay.

653
46:28.785 --> 46:32.345
Please give it to Wei Rao for me and wish her a speedy recovery.

654
46:38.345 --> 46:39.465
Thank you.

655
46:43.705 --> 46:45.225
Want to know if she truly loves you?

656
46:47.905 --> 46:49.265
Why not putting it to a test?

657
46:52.345 --> 46:53.185
How?

658
46:55.705 --> 46:57.025
Figure it out yourself.

659
49:11.465 --> 49:14.505
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
